from rest_framework.views import APIView
from rest_framework.response import Response
from rest_framework import permissions, status
from django.contrib.sites.shortcuts import get_current_site
from .models import PromotionCoupon, ShoppingCart

class ApplyCouponView(APIView):
    permission_classes = [permissions.IsAuthenticated]

    def post(self, request):
        coupon_code = request.data.get('code')
        current_site = get_current_site(request)
        cart = ShoppingCart.objects.filter(user=request.user, is_active=True).first()
        if not cart:
            return Response({'error': 'Active cart not found'}, status=status.HTTP_400_BAD_REQUEST)

        coupon = PromotionCoupon.objects.filter(code=coupon_code, is_active=True, site=current_site).first()
        if not coupon:
            return Response({'error': 'Coupon invalid or not valid for this storefront'}, status=status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND)

        cart.applied_coupon = coupon
        cart.save(update_fields=['applied_coupon'])
        return Response({'success': True, 'discount_percentage': coupon.discount_percent})
